==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Esperanto ''[[neni-]]'' (negative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix) + ''[[-am]]'' (correlative suffix of time).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/neˈniam/|lang=eo}}

===Adverb===
'''neniam'''
# [[never]]
#: [[mi|Mi]] '''neniam''' fumas. {{IPA|/mi neˈniam ˈfumas/|lang=eo}} - [[I]] '''never''' smoke.
#: Mi '''neniam''' vidis [[ŝi|ŝin]]. {{IPA|/mi neˈniam ˈvidis ʃin/|lang=eo}} - I '''never''' saw [[her]].

====Antonyms====
* [[ĉiam]]

====Derived terms====
* [[neniamo]]

